{"sections":[{"slug":"整数环的pro-有限完备化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"整数环的pro-有限完备化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">整数环的</span> pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限完备化</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“整数环的 pro-有限完备化”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">整数环的</span> pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限完备化</span> $\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义为</span>\n$$\r\n\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}} =\\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/n\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为环同构于所有</span> $p$-<span lang=\"zh\">进整数环的乘积</span>:\n$$\r\n\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}\\simeq \\prod_{p}\\mathbb{Z}_p\r\n$$</p>\n"}}}]}